<title>USA: Suburban Ostomy acquires Peiser's.</title>
<headline>Suburban Ostomy acquires Peiser's.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLISTON, Mass. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Ostomy Supply Co Inc said Friday that it has completed the acquisition of Peiser's Medical Supplies and Services for $8 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>The company said that the transaction is expected to to be accretive to earnings in the first year.</p>
<p>Peiser's, said the company, is a home health medical supply distribution company that had revenue of $17 million in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Suburban Ostomy is a national direct marketing wholesaler of medical supplies and related products to the home health care industry. It had $44.8 million in sales in the six months ended March 31.</p>
</text>
